### 4. Technical UI/UX Auditing Suite: Impeccable Skill Diagnostic Scan (`tests/e2e/impeccable-audit.spec.ts`)

A systematic, automated technical quality audit executing the 5 diagnostic dimensions and strict craft-floor rules of the **Impeccable Design System**:

#### 4.1 Dimension 1: Accessibility (A11y) Audit (Target Score: 4/4)
- **Color Contrast**:
  - Evaluates computed contrast ratios for all text elements:
    * Normal body text against Parchment Ground (`#FAF8F5`): >= 4.5:1 (Granite Deep `#111113` yields 17.5:1, Granite Muted `#7A736B` yields 4.52:1).
    * Terracotta primary button fill (`#B85D36`) with white text (`#FFFFFF`): >= 4.65:1 (passes WCAG AA).
    * Terracotta text links (`#9E4723`) on parchment ground: >= 4.72:1 (passes WCAG AA).
    * High-contrast obsidian headlines (`#111113`): >= 17.5:1 (exceeds WCAG AAA).
- **Motion Sensitivity (`prefers-reduced-motion`)**:
  - Tests page rendering with `emulateMedia({ reducedMotion: 'reduce' })`.
  - Confirms ambient video canvas suppresses auto-looping without layout jump.
  - Confirms spring counters transition cleanly to final values without blocking reading or focus.
  - Confirms slide-over drawers (`CouncilDetailDrawer`, `DonationDrawer`) use instant/fade transitions instead of large translation sweeps.
- **Keyboard Navigation & ARIA Semantic Hierarchy**:
  - Confirms skip-to-content anchor targets `#main-content`.
  - Confirms single sequential `<h1>` on the landing page, followed by strictly nested `<h2>` landmarks for each section.
  - Validates visible focus rings on all interactive elements (`focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--color-terracotta-primary)]`).
  - Verifies modal & drawer focus trapping: when `DonationDrawer` or `CouncilDetailDrawer` is open, `Tab` cycling is trapped within the overlay, and `Escape` restores focus to the invoking element.

#### 4.2 Dimension 2: Performance & Motion Choreography (Target Score: 4/4)
- **Render Stability & Layout Thrashing**:
  - Verifies zero layout-property animations (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left` in CSS transitions or Motion variants).
  - Confirms all animated surfaces use composite-only hardware-accelerated transforms (`transform: translate3d(...)`, `opacity`).
- **Asset Loading & Optimization**:
  - Verifies above-the-fold Hero poster (`image-monolith-civic.svg`) loads with `priority`.
  - Verifies below-the-fold images (`image-health-outreach.svg`, `image-youth-education.svg`) load with native `loading="lazy"`.
  - Validates responsive `viewBox` attributes on all SVGs (`0 0 1200 800`, `0 0 400 80`, `0 0 100 120`) preventing layout shifts (CLS = 0).

#### 4.3 Dimension 3: Theming & Token Fidelity (Target Score: 4/4)
- **Token Discipline**:
  - Audits stylesheet and computed element styles against the Warm Afro-Modernism palette:
    `--color-terracotta-primary: #B85D36`, `--color-terracotta-link: #9E4723`, `--color-terracotta-surface: #F9EFEB`, `--color-granite-deep: #111113`, `--color-granite-card: #1E1E22`, `--color-granite-muted: #7A736B`, `--color-savannah-primary: #1C3F35`, `--color-savannah-surface: #E8F0ED`, `--color-parchment-ground: #FAF8F5`, `--color-parchment-subtle: #F3EFEA`, `--color-parchment-border: #E5DFD5`, `--color-ochre-accent: #D49B35`.
  - Verifies zero arbitrary unapproved hex colors in component inline styles.
- **Browser Surfaces Craft**:
  - Confirms text selection is themed from the palette: `selection:bg-[var(--color-terracotta-surface)] selection:text-[var(--color-terracotta-primary)]`.
  - Confirms focus outlines are styled with terracotta accent, eliminating browser default blue halos.

#### 4.4 Dimension 4: Responsive Design & Ergonomics (Target Score: 4/4)
- **Viewport Fluidity**:
  - Tests 5 distinct viewport sizes: 320px (iPhone SE / small mobile), 375px (standard mobile), 768px (tablet portrait), 1024px (tablet landscape), and 1440px (desktop wide).
  - Confirms zero horizontal scrollbars or document overflow (`document.documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth`).
  - Validates fluid headline typography using `clamp()` formulas that gracefully scale without line wraps exceeding 3 lines on mobile.
- **Touch Ergonomics**:
  - Audits interactive tap targets across mobile viewports: confirms all buttons, navigation pills, council markers, and currency tabs have minimum hit areas of 44x44px.

#### 4.5 Dimension 5: Implementation Integrity & Craft Floor Bans (Target Score: 4/4)
- **Strict Craft-Floor Bans Automated Scan**:
  - **Zero Text Gradients**: Verifies zero CSS classes matching `bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-...`. Visual emphasis is achieved exclusively through typographic weight and size.
  - **Zero Raw Neobrutalist Block Shadows**: Verifies zero `box-shadow: 4px 4px 0` or harsh unblurred offsets. Depth is authored exclusively through layered soft ambient shadows (`shadow-soft`, `shadow-card`, `shadow-modal`).
  - **Zero Monospace as Decorative Costume**: Verifies monospace fonts are never used as decorative badge labels or eyebrow kickers; monospace is strictly reserved for technical data (CAC numbers, GTBank sort codes, TINs, IBANs).
  - **Zero Nested Cards Inside Cards**: Confirms bento grid items and project drawers use clean single-surface containers without cards-inside-cards nesting.
  - **Verified Direction Contract**: Confirms `<!-- IMPECCABLE DIRECTION CONTRACT: Warm Afro-Modernism | Abuja Resilience Initiative -->` exists as the immediate first child of `<body>` in `src/app/layout.tsx`.

